# Analytics + Advertising Rules (Every HTML Page)

## 1. Google Analytics (GA4) — Required on ALL HTML pages
Measurement ID is always `G-XXZS8C1FLY`. Never omit it. Never use another GA property (`G-TMJQ8CNQKL` is retired).

Place in `<head>`:

```html
<script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-XXZS8C1FLY"></script>
<script>window.dataLayer=window.dataLayer||[];function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}gtag('js',new Date());gtag('config','G-XXZS8C1FLY');</script>
```

Applies to: homepage, tools, problems, courses, premium, labs, legal, admin, redirects, 404.

---

## 2. Google AdSense — Required on ALL Public & Course Content Pages
Publisher is only `ca-pub-6672302762343789` (matches `ads.txt`). Never `ca-pub-4218140747629892` or other IDs.

Place at the top of `<head>`:

```html
<script async src="https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-6672302762343789" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
```

Put it on: learning articles, tools, labs, problems, premium courses, premium course lessons, and category indexes.
Skip AdSense only on: `/admin/` and empty HTTP-refresh redirect stubs.

---

## 3. EthicalAds — Required on Content, Tools, Labs & Course Pages
Client script placed in `<head>`:

```html
<script async src="https://media.ethicalads.io/media/client/ethicalads.min.js"></script>
```

Publisher ID is `ecrionixorg`.

### Placements:
1. **Sticky Box Unit** — Place immediately below `<body>`:
```html
<div id="ea-content" data-ea-publisher="ecrionixorg" data-ea-type="image" data-ea-style="stickybox" class="raised adaptive-css" data-ea-keywords="vlsi|semiconductor|electronics|engineering|rtl|asic|physical-design"></div>
```
*(Tailor `data-ea-keywords` to the page topic: e.g. `vlsi|semiconductor|rtl|verilog|timing|digital-logic`)*

2. **In-Content Safe Unit** — Place in main content area (between sections or before footer/navigation):
```html
<div class="ad-safe-container" style="margin:2.5rem 0; display:flex; justify-content:center;">
  <div id="page-content-ad" data-ea-publisher="ecrionixorg" data-ea-type="image" class="raised adaptive-css" data-ea-keywords="vlsi|semiconductor|electronics|engineering|rtl|asic"></div>
</div>
```

---

## 4. Enforcement Rule for Future Pages
**MANDATORY:** Whenever creating or editing any new course, lesson, lab, tool, calculator, visualizer, or article page:
- **Always** verify that both the Google AdSense and EthicalAds scripts are in `<head>`.
- **Always** verify that the EthicalAds stickybox unit and safe in-content unit are added.
- **Always** verify GA4 `G-XXZS8C1FLY` is in `<head>`.
Never omit ads when adding new pages or lessons.
